# Split Head boss fight (map1_s05): New Game on the arena, the intro scene paged with Cross, then the
# handgun (console give/equip) against the boss: aim (R2) and fire (Cross) bursts with turns and runs;
# a console hurt brings the boss low enough that the shots finish it.
# The equip must land in the ticks between the end of the intro (control back, tick 1016) and the first R2
# (tick 1020): earlier the player has no control, later the aim pose refuses a weapon swap.
#@config skip_intros = 2
#@config map = map1_s05
#@console @2 give Handgun
#@console @2 give HandgunBullets
#@console @2 give HandgunBullets
#@console @17.15 equip Handgun
#@console @45 hurt 24000
#@timeout 600
